sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch03-12> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch03-12: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.73" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.728"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "resolvable-now" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.62"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Fetal size by week of gestation is tabulated in a large public standard, and locating a velocity maximum is a direct calculation. The fifth-month inflection is specific enough to fail if the peak lies elsewhere. The remaining weakness is that the measured length is often a skeletal segment rather than whole-body length, so the test is exact only if that proxy tracks the length Thompson plotted. That is a limited measurement issue, not a missing dataset." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate human fetal length velocity by gestational age. A maximum near the fifth month, with velocity rising before it and falling after, would support the claim. A maximum far from that month, or no inflection, would refute it. Femur length or crown-rump length may stand in for crown-heel length if the two are shown to share the same velocity peak." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Modern standards usually record femur length or crown-rump length rather than the crown-heel length of the older curves.", "Dating error and cross-sectional sampling can shift the apparent month of the inflection." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok--dataset-1> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch03-12 by Grok 4.7: 0.85" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.85"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch03-12> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch03-12--grok--operationalizability> .
